# Clerk Rouhi at the Dead Letter Office (CIPlay dead_letter_office_talk, 11-12 w12 prep; in a test world 'CI ...').
# Clerk Rouhi sits at the ruined house on the shore (55 -24.5). Answer 1: her held letter in the journal. Answer 2: shows the
# vault hatch (dlvaulthatch) and says where it is. Answer 3: the returned stamp. Offline-written, never run.
island The Dead Letter Office
offset 0 42
hour 11
weather Calm
expect hidden dlvaulthatch
picture dl_islander 51.8 +2.4 -21.2 55 +0.9 -24.5
use Clerk Rouhi
expect step 0
use Clerk Rouhi pick 1
expect message grey envelope
use Clerk Rouhi pick 3
expect message One less for the sea
expect hidden dlvaulthatch
use Clerk Rouhi pick 2
expect message stairs behind the counter
expect shown dlvaulthatch
